## The following text has been annotated for parts of speech by students at NTU Singapore as part of a class project in AY 2025.
## Verses are extracted from the taggedPBC. Annotations have been developed with a combination of manual and automated approaches, with reference to existing literature and (where possible) native speakers.
## ISO 639-3: kan, Language: Kannada, Number of verses: 1885
## References: Akshay, M., & Dinesh, K. S. (2019). Parts of Speech (POS) Tagging for Kannada Using Conditional Random Fields and Sandhi Splitting. Proceedings of the 16th International Conference on Natural Language Processing (ICON 2019). Association for Computational Linguistics. https://aclanthology.org/R19-2005.pdf ; Todi, R., Arora, K., & Mittal, R. (2018). Building a Kannada POS Tagger Using Machine Learning and Neural Network Models. arXiv preprint arXiv:1808.03175. https://arxiv.org/abs/1808.03175 ; Udupa, A., & Murthy, K. N. (2018). A Comparison of Features for POS Tagging in Kannada. ResearchGate. https://www.researchgate.net/publication/328773946 ; Rao, R., & Rajendran, S. (2015). Parts of Speech Taggers for Dravidian Languages: Tamil, Telugu, Kannada. International Journal of Engineering Trends and Technology, 21(7), 263–268. https://ijettjournal.org/2015/volume-21/number-7/IJETT-V21P263.pdf ; Kittel, F. (1903). A Grammar of the Kannada Language. Bangalore: Basel Mission Press. (Original work published 1903). [Digitized version available via archive.org] ; Kittel, F. (1906). A Kannada–English Etymological Dictionary. Basel Mission Book & Tract Depository. [Digitized version available via archive.org] ; Naveen, S. K. (2019). Morphological Characteristics of Kannada: A Dravidian Perspective. Journal of Dravidian Linguistics, 48(2), 45–62. ; Government of India, TDIL (Technology Development for Indian Languages). (2019). Kannada Lexical Resources and Morph Analyzer. Ministry of Electronics and Information Technology. https://tdil-dc.in ; AI4Bharat & IndicNLP Library. (2022). Indic NLP Catalog — Kannada Resources. https://github.com/AI4Bharat/indicnlp_catalog

